      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave Moses ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the following regulations for the people of Israel. When a person has been given to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in fulfilment of a special vow, that person may be set free by the payment of the following sums of money, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according to the official standard:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.3+LEV.27.4+LEV.27.5+LEV.27.6+LEV.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.3",
              "LEV.27.4",
              "LEV.27.5",
              "LEV.27.6",
              "LEV.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.3+LEV.27.4+LEV.27.5+LEV.27.6+LEV.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.3",
              "LEV.27.4",
              "LEV.27.5",
              "LEV.27.6",
              "LEV.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If anyone who made the vow is too poor to pay the standard price, he or she shall bring the person to the priest, and the priest will set a lower price, according to the ability of that person to pay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the vow concerns an animal that is acceptable as an offering to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", then every gift made to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is sacred, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and anyone who made the vow may not substitute another animal for it. If he does, both animals belong to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if the vow concerns a ritually unclean animal, which is not acceptable as an offering to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the man shall take the animal to the priest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest shall fix a price for it, according to its good or bad qualities, and the price will be final. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the person wishes to buy it back, he must pay the price plus an additional twenty per cent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When someone dedicates his house to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the priest shall fix the price according to its good or bad points, and the price will be final. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the one who dedicated the house wishes to buy it back, he must pay the price plus an additional twenty per cent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If someone dedicates part of his land to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the price shall be fixed according to the amount of seed it takes to sow it, at the rate of ten pieces of silver for every twenty kilogrammes of barley. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he dedicates the land immediately after a Year of Restoration, the full price applies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he dedicates it later, the priest shall estimate the cash value according to the number of years left until the next Year of Restoration, and fix a reduced price. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the one who dedicated the field wishes to buy it back, he or she must pay the price plus an additional twenty per cent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If they sell the field to someone else without first buying it back from the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", they lose the right to buy it back. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the next Year of Restoration the field will become the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s permanent property; it shall belong to the priests.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
