            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 14.22–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One-tenth of all the produce of the land, whether grain or fruit, belongs to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a man wishes to buy any of it back, he must pay the standard price plus an additional twenty per cent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One out of every ten domestic animals belongs to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". When the animals are counted, every tenth one belongs to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The owner may not arrange the animals so that the poor animals are chosen, and he may not make any substitutions. If he does substitute one animal for another, then both animals will belong to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and may not be bought back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
